+/*
+ * iOS 18 (xnu-11215) trap 88 is exclaves_ctl_trap. launchd's exclaves-boot task calls it; on
+ * devices without exclaves the kernel answers KERN_NOT_SUPPORTED and launchd goes on, while
+ * kern_invalid here raises EXC_SYSCALL -> SIGSYS and pid 1 dies (namespace 2 subcode 0xc).
